# .env.example - template for environment variables. Copy to .env and
# fill in real values; .env itself is gitignored and must never be
# committed.
#
# Current state, honestly: neither the World Bank API nor PSA OpenSTAT
# require an API key - both are open, unauthenticated endpoints. So
# there is nothing secret to configure yet. This file exists as the
# established PLACE for future secrets to go, rather than being added
# ad-hoc later and possibly committed by accident.
#
# Likely future additions, when they happen:
#   DAGSTER_HOME=              # if scheduling Dagster somewhere persistent
#   VERCEL_TOKEN=               # if automating deploys outside the Vercel Git integration
